# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to bake your OWN family-notification topic into a source build.
# Format: thodu- followed by 3 or 4 groups of 4 characters from a-z and 2-7, for example
# thodu-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx (use random letters; anyone who knows the topic can read the messages).
# Leave empty for a topic-free build: the app then stays in demo mode until you make a topic in
# Settings > Family notifications on the TV.
EXPO_PUBLIC_THODU_TOPIC=
